<title>INDIA: India produced 11,912 tonnes zinc in April.</title>
<headline>India produced 11,912 tonnes zinc in April.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 11,912 tonnes of zinc in April, up from 8,932 in April 1996, the government said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   Installed		Production</p>
<p>	   capacity     April 1997	April 1996</p>
<p>	   (annual)</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> HZL     152,000	  10,591	     7,822</p>
<p> BZL	30,000	   1,321	     1,110</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> TOTAL   182,000	  11,912	     8,932</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes and provisional</p>
</text>
